{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54019","headline":"赋诗以谢步非烟 · 赵象","name":"赋诗以谢步非烟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍重佳人赠好音，彩牋芳翰两情深。\n薄於蝉翼难供恨，密似蝇头未写心。\n疑是落花迷碧洞，只思轻雨洒幽襟。\n百回消息千回梦，裁作长谣寄绿琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}